{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103732","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103732","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710373201:1":{"text":"編集長さんの話を聞いた？王女様が剣を抜けなかったらしいわよ！","source_cn":"听到了吗？主编亲口说的！公主拔不出剑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DA3333008654EC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710373202:1":{"text":"これはきっと、ペギー様には王位を継ぐ資格はないという、大帝のご意志だよ！","source_cn":"一定是大帝在以此昭告天下——佩吉根本没有资格继承那个位置！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E443E8705992A52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710373203:1":{"text":"まだ分からないの？これは事故なんかじゃないわ！","source_cn":"你们还不明白吗？这根本不是意外！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8363B23EF76B7C76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710373204:1":{"text":"国王陛下がご病気になられたのに、王妃様はいまだにエイドリアン殿下に実権を譲ろうとせず、「陛下のご指示だ」とか言って政治を取り仕切ってるんだから！","source_cn":"国王陛下病重已久，王后却迟迟不肯将权力交给王子，反而借...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAA336CAFE9A57B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710373205:1":{"text":"しまいには、今度はその娘がカリバーンを抜こうとしたですって……あの母娘は王権を独り占めしようと企んでるに違いないわ！","source_cn":"现在她女儿又跑去强拔石中剑……这对母女，分明是想窃取王权！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC9CF530EC3B10C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710373206:1":{"text":"今思えば、あの時のペギー様の振る舞いは、たしかに少々不遜だったわねぇ……","source_cn":"哎呀……现在回想起来，当时公主殿下的态度确实有些……太...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1C9552FD377F853","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710373207:1":{"text":"なんというか、さも自分が抜くのが当然だと言わんばかりで……先祖への敬意が、まったく感じられなかったわ……","source_cn":"啧啧啧，那种势在必得的样子，真是对先祖毫无敬畏之心啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF9617638F68369B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710373208:1":{"text":"そうそう！大法官様が止めようとしても、聞く耳を持たず、強引に引き抜こうとしていたな！","source_cn":"没错！当时连大法官阁下都劝阻她了，可公主殿下根本听不进...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC854649F5064635A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710373209:1":{"text":"聞いたか！？なんて傲慢なんだ！あの母にして、この娘ありだな！","source_cn":"听听！多狂妄啊！这就是王后教出来的女儿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x660EE5019B6E8AB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710373210:1":{"text":"何が摂政だ。そう言って王位を簒奪しようと企んでるんだろ。だからローランド大帝も、耐えかねて顕現されたんだ！","source_cn":"什么摄政，我看就是篡位的前兆！罗兰大帝一定是看不下去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12FAA0CA2822ACB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":